From 46985b955bb1adf734d0e9ded5f98177b4d65952 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:15:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] fix(#95): authored_fence, contradicted_flags,
 environment_gated, redundant_dispositions, unresolved_mutants and
 write_refused_records are read directly

The defect, verbatim from the issue: "If a producer renames or stops setting one, the read silently
becomes 'clean'." Fifteen sites read these six with a default of `()` / `0`: "no fence, no contradicted
flag, no environment gate, no redundant test, no mutant without a verdict, no refused write".

Why the obvious fix is wrong: each reader holds the type that declares the field (`SurvivorReport`:
authored_fence, contradicted_flags, write_refused_records; `ConvergeResult`: environment_gated,
unresolved_mutants; `SuiteAudit`: authored_fence, redundant_dispositions, unresolved_mutants,
environment_gated), so an absent answer is a renamed field, not a state of the object. The two places a
value can legitimately be missing are the `None` report (no classification ran, so no refused records)
and the `None` proof, both handled by an explicit `is not None` branch that already existed.
`_redundant_kept` used to answer "no kept test" for an object without the field; its test now asserts
the read raises, and keeps the case it actually documents (a SuiteAudit that recorded none, `()`).

Converted: audit.audit_suite, converge._named_write_refused, and in cli _run_audit, _converge_blocked,
_format_audit, _contradicted_flag_lines, _verdict_flag_pairs, _format_converge_terse, _converge_routing,
_converge_action, _residual_action, _redundant_kept. Test doubles gain the fields.

Not closed: not_consulted, not_consulted_dynamic and missing_line_standings (the open-line census).

FAULT_OPEN: authored_fence 3, contradicted_flags 2, environment_gated 4, redundant_dispositions 1,
unresolved_mutants 2, write_refused_records 2 -> 0. Disarmed, 5 of 5 new/changed intent tests fail.
The 33-file neighbour set (686 tests) and the four guards pass under 3.14 and 3.12; ruff clean under
pinned 0.16.7.
